    {
      "question": "I have 1 Life card and take 2 damage from my opponent's [Double Attack]. This is the Life card I check for the first damage and I activate its [Trigger]. In this case, does adding 1 card to my Life cards according to this [Trigger] occur before processing the second damage of the [Double Attack]?",
